        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \u222bedx.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (1)/(x) + C]\nb. [MATH: (x)/(e) + C]\nc. [MATH: e^{x} + C]\nd. [MATH: (e^{2})/(2) + C]\ne. [MATH: ex + C]"
